# raw Inspect logs and per-episode artifacts are large; hashes and summaries are committed
# (the follow-up variants fu2/, fu4/, fu4b/, fu5/ have their own results/ and data/ subtrees)
results/logs/
results/episodes/
results/*/logs/
results/*/episodes/
# contexts hold replayed workspaces + X3b prefixes (regenerable by p23/contexts.py from the
# X3b data); their sha256 is in data/MANIFEST.sha256
data/contexts*.jsonl
data/*/contexts*.jsonl
